{
  "title": "EBS · SAA-C03 개념 위키",
  "description": "EC2에 연결하는 AZ 단위의 영속 블록 볼륨이다.",
  "main": "<nav class=\"breadcrumb\" aria-label=\"현재 위치\"><a href=\"/concepts/\">개념 위키</a><span aria-hidden=\"true\">/</span><span>EBS <span class=\"full-name\">(Elastic Block Store)</span></span></nav><div class=\"wiki-layout\"><aside class=\"wiki-toc\"><details open><summary>이 문서의 목차</summary><nav aria-label=\"문서 목차\"><ol><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/ebs/#overview\">개요</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/ebs/#comparison\">비교표</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/ebs/#gp3\">gp3</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/ebs/#gp2\">gp2</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/ebs/#io2-block-express\">io2 Block Express</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/ebs/#io1\">io1</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/ebs/#st1\">st1</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/ebs/#sc1-and-magnetic\">sc1 and Magnetic</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/ebs/#ebs-multi-attach\">EBS Multi-Attach</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/ebs/#encryption\">Encryption</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/ebs/#elastic-volumes\">Elastic Volumes</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/ebs/#deleteontermination-and-persistence\">DeleteOnTermination and Persistence</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/ebs/#ebs-optimized-and-monitoring\">EBS-Optimized and Monitoring</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/ebs/#scenario\">적용 예시</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/ebs/#references\">AWS 공식 문서</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/ebs/#practice\">연관 문제 5개</a></li></ol></nav></details><a class=\"back-index\" href=\"/concepts/\">← 전체 개념 보기</a></aside><div class=\"wiki-main\"><article class=\"term-article\"><header class=\"article-header\"><div class=\"term-meta\"><span>스토리지</span><span>13 / 62</span></div><h1>EBS <span class=\"full-name\">(Elastic Block Store)</span></h1><p class=\"article-date\">공식 문서 확인 2026-09-30 · 11 subtopics</p></header><section id=\"overview\" class=\"overview\"><h2>개요</h2><p>Amazon EBS <span class=\"full-name\">(Elastic Block Store)</span>는 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/\">EC2</a>에 연결하는 영구 Block Volume이다. OS의 File System 또는 Database가 Block I/O <span class=\"full-name\">(Input/Output)</span>를 사용하며, 일반적으로 Instance 수명과 Volume 보존 정책을 별도로 관리할 수 있다.</p><p>Volume은 한 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a>에 속하므로 다른 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a>의 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/\">EC2</a>에 직접 연결할 수 없다. 성능은 Volume Type·Size·설정 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/types/#iops-throughput-and-latency\">IOPS</a>·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/types/#iops-throughput-and-latency\">Throughput</a>과 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/\">EC2</a>의 EBS <span class=\"full-name\">(Elastic Block Store)</span> 대역폭 중 가장 제한적인 조건의 영향을 받는다.</p></section><section class=\"visual\" aria-label=\"Volume 연결과 AZ 이동\"><figure class=\"diagram\"><figcaption><b>Volume 연결과 AZ 이동</b></figcaption><div class=\"diagram-body\"><div class=\"visual-lanes\"><div class=\"visual-lane\"><h3>Within an AZ</h3><div class=\"node navy\"><strong>EBS <span class=\"full-name\">(Elastic Block Store)</span> Volume</strong><small><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ebs/#gp3\">gp3</a>·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ebs/#io2-block-express\">io2</a>·HDD <span class=\"full-name\">(Hard Disk Drive)</span> 선택</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node blue\"><strong><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/\">EC2</a> in same <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a></strong><small>Block Device 연결</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node navy\"><strong>File System / Database</strong><small>OS에서 I/O <span class=\"full-name\">(Input/Output)</span> 수행</small></div></div><div class=\"visual-lane\"><h3>Across AZs</h3><div class=\"node navy\"><strong><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/snapshot/\">EBS Snapshot</a></strong><small>일관된 시점 Backup</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node blue\"><strong>New Volume in <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a> B</strong><small>Snapshot에서 생성</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node navy\"><strong><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/\">EC2</a> in <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a> B</strong><small>새 Volume 연결</small></div></div></div><p class=\"diagram-note\"><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ebs/#ebs-multi-attach\">Multi-Attach</a>도 같은 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a>의 지원 Instance·Volume과 Cluster-aware 쓰기가 필요하다.</p></div></figure></section><section id=\"comparison\" class=\"wiki-section\"><h2>비교표</h2><div class=\"table-scroll\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"비교표\"><table><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\">Type</th><th scope=\"col\">Media</th><th scope=\"col\">Workload</th><th scope=\"col\">Boot</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ebs/#gp3\">gp3</a> / <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ebs/#gp2\">gp2</a></td><td>SSD <span class=\"full-name\">(Solid State Drive)</span></td><td>일반 Random I/O <span class=\"full-name\">(Input/Output)</span></td><td>지원</td></tr><tr><td><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ebs/#io2-block-express\">io2</a> / <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ebs/#io1\">io1</a></td><td>SSD <span class=\"full-name\">(Solid State Drive)</span></td><td>Provisioned <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/types/#iops-throughput-and-latency\">IOPS</a></td><td>지원</td></tr><tr><td><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ebs/#st1\">st1</a></td><td>HDD <span class=\"full-name\">(Hard Disk Drive)</span></td><td>빈번한 Sequential</td><td>미지원</td></tr><tr><td><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ebs/#sc1-and-magnetic\">sc1</a></td><td>HDD <span class=\"full-name\">(Hard Disk Drive)</span></td><td>드문 Sequential</td><td>미지원</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"gp3\"><h2>gp3<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ebs/#gp3\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ebs/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>일반용 SSD <span class=\"full-name\">(Solid State Drive)</span>이며 Size와 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/types/#iops-throughput-and-latency\">IOPS</a>·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/types/#iops-throughput-and-latency\">Throughput</a>을 독립적으로 조정한다. 일반 Boot·앱·DB <span class=\"full-name\">(Database)</span> 용도로 비교하는 기본 선택이다. 과거의 최대 성능 수치를 현재 한도로 고정하지 말고 최신 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/region/\">Region</a>·Instance 지원과 Quota를 확인한다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"gp2\"><h2>gp2<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ebs/#gp2\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ebs/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>일반용 SSD <span class=\"full-name\">(Solid State Drive)</span>로 성능이 주로 Volume Size와 연동되며 작은 Volume의 Burst Credit 모델을 사용한다. 지속 I/O <span class=\"full-name\">(Input/Output)</span>가 많은 작은 Volume은 Credit 소진 시 성능을 확인해야 한다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ebs/#gp3\">gp3</a>로 전환하면 용량 증가 없이 성능 설정을 분리할 수 있다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"io2-block-express\"><h2>io2 Block Express<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ebs/#io2-block-express\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ebs/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>높은 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/types/#iops-throughput-and-latency\">IOPS</a>·낮은 지연·높은 내구성이 필요한 I/O <span class=\"full-name\">(Input/Output)</span> 집약 Workload에 사용한다. Provisioned <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/types/#iops-throughput-and-latency\">IOPS</a>와 지원 Instance 조건을 확인한다. DB <span class=\"full-name\">(Database)</span> 자체의 Lock·Query 병목은 Volume 성능을 높여도 해결되지 않는다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"io1\"><h2>io1<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ebs/#io1\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ebs/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>이전 세대 Provisioned <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/types/#iops-throughput-and-latency\">IOPS</a> SSD <span class=\"full-name\">(Solid State Drive)</span>다. 고성능·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ebs/#ebs-multi-attach\">Multi-Attach</a> 지원 조건이 있지만 신규 요구에서는 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ebs/#io2-block-express\">io2</a>와 비용·내구성·지원 구성을 비교한다. Provisioned <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/types/#iops-throughput-and-latency\">IOPS</a>를 실제로 쓰려면 Instance 대역폭도 충분해야 한다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"st1\"><h2>st1<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ebs/#st1\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ebs/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/types/#iops-throughput-and-latency\">Throughput</a> Optimized HDD <span class=\"full-name\">(Hard Disk Drive)</span>로 큰 Sequential I/O <span class=\"full-name\">(Input/Output)</span>와 자주 읽는 대용량 데이터에 적합하다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/types/#iops-throughput-and-latency\">IOPS</a>가 중요한 작은 Random I/O <span class=\"full-name\">(Input/Output)</span>에는 SSD <span class=\"full-name\">(Solid State Drive)</span>를 비교한다. HDD <span class=\"full-name\">(Hard Disk Drive)</span> Volume은 Boot Volume으로 사용할 수 없다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"sc1-and-magnetic\"><h2>sc1 and Magnetic<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ebs/#sc1-and-magnetic\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ebs/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ebs/#sc1-and-magnetic\">sc1</a>은 드물게 읽는 대용량 Sequential 데이터용 Cold HDD <span class=\"full-name\">(Hard Disk Drive)</span>다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ebs/#sc1-and-magnetic\">Magnetic</a>은 이전 세대 Standard Volume으로 남아 있다. 새 설계는 현재 SSD <span class=\"full-name\">(Solid State Drive)</span>·HDD <span class=\"full-name\">(Hard Disk Drive)</span> Class에서 요구 성능과 비용을 비교하며 낮은 가격만으로 Boot·Random DB <span class=\"full-name\">(Database)</span> 용도에 선택하지 않는다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"ebs-multi-attach\"><h2>EBS <span class=\"full-name\">(Elastic Block Store)</span> Multi-Attach<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ebs/#ebs-multi-attach\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ebs/#reference-2\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 2\">[2]</a></h2><p>지원 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ebs/#io1\">io1</a>·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ebs/#io2-block-express\">io2</a> Volume을 같은 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a>의 여러 지원 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/\">EC2</a>에 연결한다. 동시에 쓰는 애플리케이션은 Cluster-aware File System 또는 쓰기 조정이 필요하다. 일반 File System을 여러 Host에서 그대로 Mount하는 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/efs/\">EFS</a> 대체재가 아니다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"encryption\"><h2>Encryption<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ebs/#encryption\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ebs/#reference-2\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 2\">[2]</a></h2><p>EBS <span class=\"full-name\">(Elastic Block Store)</span> Encryption은 Volume·Snapshot과 Instance 사이 데이터 전송에 통합된다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/kms/\">KMS</a> Key 권한을 잃으면 Restore·Attach에 영향이 있을 수 있다. 기존 암호화되지 않은 Volume은 암호화 Snapshot Copy에서 새 Volume을 만드는 방식 등을 사용한다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"elastic-volumes\"><h2>Elastic Volumes<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ebs/#elastic-volumes\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ebs/#reference-2\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 2\">[2]</a></h2><p>지원 조건에서 Volume Size·Type·성능을 변경할 수 있다. Size 증가 뒤 OS Partition·File System 확장이 필요할 수 있다. 단순 설정 변경으로 Volume Size를 축소하는 기능은 아니다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"deleteontermination-and-persistence\"><h2>DeleteOnTermination and Persistence<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ebs/#deleteontermination-and-persistence\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ebs/#reference-2\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 2\">[2]</a></h2><p><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ami/#root-volume\">Root Volume</a>의 DeleteOnTermination 설정에 따라 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/\">EC2</a> 종료 때 Volume이 삭제될 수 있다. Stop은 일반적으로 EBS <span class=\"full-name\">(Elastic Block Store)</span> 데이터를 유지하지만 과금도 남는다. Instance 종료 전 데이터와 Snapshot 보존 정책을 확인한다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"ebs-optimized-and-monitoring\"><h2>EBS <span class=\"full-name\">(Elastic Block Store)</span>-Optimized and Monitoring<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ebs/#ebs-optimized-and-monitoring\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ebs/#reference-2\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 2\">[2]</a></h2><p>EBS <span class=\"full-name\">(Elastic Block Store)</span>-Optimized Instance의 전용 경로와 대역폭이 I/O <span class=\"full-name\">(Input/Output)</span> 성능에 영향을 준다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/audit/#cloudwatch-metrics-and-alarms\">CloudWatch</a> <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/types/#iops-throughput-and-latency\">IOPS</a>·Queue Length·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/types/#iops-throughput-and-latency\">Throughput</a> 및 Credit 관련 지표를 함께 본다. Storage 성능 문제와 CPU <span class=\"full-name\">(Central Processing Unit)</span>·Network 병목을 구분한다.</p></section><section id=\"scenario\" class=\"scenario\"><h2>적용 예시</h2><p>Random I/O <span class=\"full-name\">(Input/Output)</span>가 많은 DB <span class=\"full-name\">(Database)</span>는 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ebs/#io2-block-express\">io2</a> 또는 충분한 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ebs/#gp3\">gp3</a> 성능을 검토한다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a> 이동은 Snapshot에서 대상 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a>의 새 Volume을 만들고 연결하는 방식으로 설계한다.</p></section><aside class=\"tip\"><b>시험에서 구별할 점</b><p>다른 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a>의 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/\">EC2</a>로 볼륨을 직접 붙일 수 없으며 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/snapshot/\">스냅샷</a>에서 그 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a>에 새 볼륨을 만든다.</p></aside><section id=\"references\" class=\"references\"><h2>AWS 공식 문서</h2><p>위 첨자는 아래 공식 문서로 연결됩니다. 서비스 제공 조건은 확인일 기준입니다.</p><ol><li id=\"reference-1\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/ebs/latest/userguide/ebs-volume-types.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">ebs/latest/userguide/ebs-volume-types.html ↗</a></li><li id=\"reference-2\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/ebs/latest/userguide/ebs-volumes.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">ebs/latest/userguide/ebs-volumes.html ↗</a></li></ol></section></article><section id=\"practice\" class=\"related-questions\"><div class=\"section-heading\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">PRACTICE · ENGLISH</p><h2>연관 문제 5개</h2></div><a href=\"/concepts/quiz/q039/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q039\" data-question=\"Q039\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"0\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q039</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q039/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">An EC2 instance needs an operating-system-visible volume for database files. What type of storage is required?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q039\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Block storage</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q039\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Object storage</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q039\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">DNS</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q039\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Publish/subscribe messaging</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 A</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ebs/\">EBS</a> 같은 블록 장치가 파일 시스템을 생성해 사용하는 볼륨이다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/types/\">Object / File / Block</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ebs/\">EBS</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q044\" data-question=\"Q044\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"0\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q044</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q044/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">Can an EBS volume in AZ A be attached directly to an EC2 instance in AZ B?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q044\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">No. The volume and instance must be in the same AZ</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q044\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Yes. Both AZs are in the same Region</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q044\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Yes, if the instance has a public IP address</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q044\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Yes, if CloudFront is configured</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 A</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ebs/\">EBS</a> 볼륨과 연결 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/\">EC2</a>는 같은 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a>여야 한다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/snapshot/\">스냅샷</a>에서 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a> B에 새 볼륨을 만들 수 있다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ebs/\">EBS</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/snapshot/\">EBS Snapshot</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q045\" data-question=\"Q045\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"3\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q045</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q045/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A company needs a general-purpose SSD volume for an EC2 boot or application workload and wants to adjust IOPS and throughput. Which EBS type should it choose first?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q045\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">EFS One Zone</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q045\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">S3 Standard</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q045\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">sc1</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q045\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">gp3</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 D</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ebs/#gp3\">gp3</a>는 범용 SSD <span class=\"full-name\">(Solid State Drive)</span>이며 용량과 별도로 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/types/#iops-throughput-and-latency\">IOPS</a>·처리량 설정을 조정할 수 있다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ebs/\">EBS</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q052\" data-question=\"Q052\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"2\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q052</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q052/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A company wants to centrally manage backup schedules and retention policies for EBS and RDS across multiple accounts. Which service should it choose?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q052\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">A Network Load Balancer</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q052\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">An SCP alone</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q052\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">AWS Backup</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q052\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon CloudFront</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 C</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/backup/\">AWS Backup</a>은 지원 리소스의 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/backup/\">백업</a> 계획과 보존을 중앙화한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/backup/\">AWS Backup</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ebs/\">EBS</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/rds/\">RDS</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q096\" data-question=\"Q096\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"1\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q096</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q096/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A workload needs an HDD-based EBS volume optimized for throughput during large sequential reads and writes. Which type should it consider first?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q096\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Only io2</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q096\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">st1</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q096\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Only gp3</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q096\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">S3 One Zone-IA</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 B</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ebs/#st1\">st1</a>은 처리량 최적화 HDD <span class=\"full-name\">(Hard Disk Drive)</span>다. 부팅 볼륨으로는 사용할 수 없다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ebs/\">EBS</a></div></article></section><nav class=\"sequence\" aria-label=\"용어 이동\"><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/dynamo/\">이전 용어 <b>DynamoDB</b></a></span><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/snapshot/\">다음 용어 <b>EBS Snapshot</b></a></span></nav></div></div>"
}
